d by Trustindex <span class="ti-info-icon"></span> <div class="ti-disclaimer"> <div class="ti-disclaimer-title">Top Rated Service</div> <ul class="ti-disclaimer-list"> <li class="ti-disclaimer-star"> <strong>5.0 Excellent rating</strong> Last 12 months </li> <li class="ti-disclaimer-reply"> <strong>Responds to customer reviews</strong> 94.1% response rate within 48 hours </li> <li class="ti-disclaimer-verified"> <strong>Verified by Trustindex</strong> Based on real customer reviews <a href="https://www.trustindex.io/?a=sys&amp;c=top-rated-badge&amp;url=/the-trustindex-verified-badge/" target="_blank" class="ti-disclaimer-link" rel="noopener">Learn more</a> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="ti-widget-header-tick"></div> </div> <div class="ti-reviews-container"> <div class="ti-controls"> <div class="ti-next" aria-label="Next review" role="button" tabindex="0"></div> <div class="ti-prev" aria-label="Previous review" role="button" tabindex="0"></div> </div> <div class="ti-reviews-container-wrapper"> <div class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-platform-page-url="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Google&amp;query_place_id=ChIJ9SSiyxCrx4kRyvzolqTb8Lc" data-time="1768428544" data-id="03540ecebc5d23ae404a96777ca91e10" data-language="en" data-rating="5.0" data-max-rating="5" > <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIx3EgKFPdS3T08Qcu6ljbJukQq9PBLaqu2FoheypDSYCpgdw=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIx3EgKFPdS3T08Qcu6ljbJukQq9PBLaqu2FoheypDSYCpgdw=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Bina Adigopula profile picture"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Bina Adigopula </div> <div class="ti-date">January 14, 2026</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform ti-color-blue"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->I became an Moc candidate after being a Moca Peds member in 2025.This was a very humbling experience as I had already been recertified and was in danger of losing my certification My family saw me struggle to qualify again for certified status and stuck by me ,through hours of study  buddy zooms , irritability and almost  despair! When I passed the boards they  described a sudden or immediate change of personality to &quot;more myself&quot; They heard me singing and whistling in the kitchen ,sharing their favorite shows ,returning to more cooking and entertaining In preparation . I read the Pbr guide almost 5-6 times and did the mp3 audio podcasts about 6 times The weekends were  taken up with Q banks  and I did 100 questions/day and scores 84-90% each time. i also attended the live test taking strategy course , and learned about POE  and other test taking strategies from Ashish and crew .its funny that the language of the question and the ASk was so important to focus on not always the paragraph, which Ashish playfully referred to as block&quot; My study buddies that I gathered  via  the links provided by Ashish were very supportive .One study buddy Jully who was taking her initial certification exam and passed this year is definitely a life long friend . She urged me not to give up hope and I also egged  her on .Together we  discovered each others study weaknesses .Helpful comments like from me ~ you do not know jack about cardiology and she telling me that I was sabotaging myself and that &quot; I was like along distance runner who stopped to tie my shoe in the middle of the race came along the way I was encouraged by the face book crew ,who seemed to understand how important it was to cheer us all on ,after such grueling study The Abp sites provided by  team PBR were helpful to me the week before the exam as I really understood the highlight feature and also familiarized myself  with &quot;Finish and Flag&quot; We  mercilessly quizzed each other on Board vitals ,Med study Ross review exam Q banks Chat Gpt was instrumental in generating  tables after tables after tables for difficult differential diagnosis of tick paralysis vs epidural abscesses  statistical formula , Board pearls etc. Mnemonics created by us  were the only way to remember all the various  types of leukodystrophy Armed with all this knowledge , I was very satisfied to take the  exam Opening the email ( very harrowing) happened to me by accident., To be fair I was chatting with my daughter and it suddenly opened  with the  welcome &quot;Congratulations&quot; message I  will always be grateful for Ashish Goyal&#039;s mentorship and Team PBR&#039;s ( Joanna, Carlos, Yvette) consistent stewardship  for my success<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more" ></span> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-platform-page-url="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Google&amp;query_place_id=ChIJ9SSiyxCrx4kRyvzolqTb8Lc" data-time="1766773411" data-id="bc76ae63a15d33ae18a9d1f0f199833c" data-language="en" data-rating="5.0" data-max-rating="5" > <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJc3DBc_94jtNHoJVpSDWfbMUIjia_29KAqALiYsC0ygzy-xw=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJc3DBc_94jtNHoJVpSDWfbMUIjia_29KAqALiYsC0ygzy-xw=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Jackie Guinn profile picture"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Jackie Guinn </div> <div class="ti-date">December 26, 2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform ti-color-blue"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->I have been using MOCA-PBR to pass my boards and maintain certification.  It is by far the best on-line learning tool and I have tried many tools!  All medical topics are organized by importance of information which is not only helpful for test taking but use in practice.  This organization really wants you to do well on these exams.  It is an investment well worth taking.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more" ></span> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-platform-page-url="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Google&amp;query_place_id=ChIJ9SSiyxCrx4kRyvzolqTb8Lc" data-time="1765915055" data-id="32951b46bc1603914d85072aed5fedd6" data-language="en" data-rating="5.0" data-max-rating="5" > <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWe05Ewl1HViFnNcPMSe3S7N7EBJiST1AdWrJC6oyYezppuuzY1=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWe05Ewl1HViFnNcPMSe3S7N7EBJiST1AdWrJC6oyYezppuuzY1=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100 2x" alt="Maria Liverpool profile picture"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Maria Liverpool </div> <div class="ti-date">December 16, 2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform ti-color-blue"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->I completely, without reservation recommend PBR. Ashish is committed to pediatricians passing the boards and I don&#039;t know that I could have done so without PBR. The resources are A1 and his techniques WORK! It&#039;s worth the investment!<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more" ></span> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-platform-page-url="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Google&amp;query_place_id=ChIJ9SSiyxCrx4kRyvzolqTb8Lc" data-time="1764982104" data-id="4d3e84841912821beed973c1e3c23eb6" data-language="en" data-rating="5.0" data-max-rating="5" > <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVWgT402wvFfFueEPZL5yH2HUOdllcrQmRgpAan4aYlTjsv2A=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVWgT402wvFfFueEPZL5yH2HUOdllcrQmRgpAan4aYlTjsv2A=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Juan Snijder profile picture"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Juan Snijder </div> <div class="ti-date">December 6, 2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform ti-color-blue"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Long overdue review. It&#039;s great, IMO better than MedStudy!<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more" ></span> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-platform-page-url="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Google&amp;query_place_id=ChIJ9SSiyxCrx4kRyvzolqTb8Lc" data-time="1755129063" data-id="2738f424ddf97e7210af1a0db6c97bae" data-language="en" data-rating="5.0" data-max-rating="5" > <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKqhJB1UTnmhM5myEF9wIKuuHkyqCdP4n72-0CVhBMI13EFpxuX=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKqhJB1UTnmhM5myEF9wIKuuHkyqCdP4n72-0CVhBMI13EFpxuX=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100 2x" alt="Rosalind Lopez profile picture"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Rosalind Lopez </div> <div class="ti-date">August 13, 2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform ti-color-blue"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Ashish, thank you for all your hard work and dedication to help create materials that really help! I&#039;ve benefited from PBR in passing my Boards the 2nd try, and now I have been doing consistently well on my MOC quizzes, all thanks to your resources and materials! I appreciate you, and I share your passion when I teach medical students and residents.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more" ></span> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-platform-page-url="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Google&amp;query_place_id=ChIJ9SSiyxCrx4kRyvzolqTb8Lc" data-time="1750311624" data-id="3aada7a80033dbc2dfb7808920e8409e" data-language="en" data-rating="5.0" data-max-rating="5" > <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIECNcnebCNDCi1KpSi1S0VxKixGikRgrbkqrOW1vGYy6CT7g=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIECNcnebCNDCi1KpSi1S0VxKixGikRgrbkqrOW1vGYy6CT7g=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Xithor22 profile picture"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Xithor22 </div> <div class="ti-date">June 19, 2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform ti-color-blue"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->So happy to share that I passed my boards on my 3rd attempt after becoming a VIP member. I scored a 212!! My score went up an entire 38 points and I think it had everything to do with attending the test taking strategies course with you. The previous year I had gone through all the material 4 times but being a part of the test taking strategy and your insights in how to tackle questions pushed me over the edge! Along with my study question partner, your study guide was my bible this summer and I&#039;m happy to say that I am a board certified pediatrician thanks to you!<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more" ></span> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-platform-page-url="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Google&amp;query_place_id=ChIJ9SSiyxCrx4kRyvzolqTb8Lc" data-time="1740162494" data-id="4808a0ba0c4e7dcc104e37696c1e4f76" data-language="en" data-rating="5.0" data-max-rating="5" > <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXEk5NCVJyQ7ITbvvQH6m9ODQJkVE3_8i7z6hWuWYIdu1L5G-w=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXEk5NCVJyQ7ITbvvQH6m9ODQJkVE3_8i7z6hWuWYIdu1L5G-w=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100 2x" alt="Kataretya Jenkins profile picture"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Kataretya Jenkins </div> <div class="ti-date">February 21, 2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform ti-color-blue"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Amazing board support materials. I used for the Pediatrics Boards AND for MOCA Peds. My favorite feature is the searchable online text which you can use anytime for any of the included topics and is streamlined enough to use even between questions. I am very impressed by the brevity of the topics and the ease at which you can consume the information despite being a busy practicing physician. I give it 5 stars. If you are thinking of getting it, you should. You won&#039;t regret it. Also the customer service is the best, extremely responsive.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more" ></span> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-platform-page-url="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Google&amp;query_place_id=ChIJ9SSiyxCrx4kRyvzolqTb8Lc" data-time="1739895278" data-id="be4657ba86a07a0619894b3847b56a41" data-language="en" data-rating="5.0" data-max-rating="5" > <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJz-ptN4zjeS3JIGtvE212Ji7bzv9dw378AuaLg2QTi4sdglQ=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJz-ptN4zjeS3JIGtvE212Ji7bzv9dw378AuaLg2QTi4sdglQ=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Sabrina Haniff profile picture"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Sabrina Haniff </div> <div class="ti-date">February 18, 2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform ti-color-blue"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->Really great program that helped me and my partner better prepare for our exams. Format stands out from traditional board prep with a combination of high yield content in book form, audio form and video form. Test taking strategies are an excellent tool for understanding how test questions are written for better critical thinking<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more" ></span> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-platform-page-url="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Google&amp;query_place_id=ChIJ9SSiyxCrx4kRyvzolqTb8Lc" data-time="1739893103" data-id="4e02e2273c5b5dc901ceab1cf4f7ea4b" data-language="en" data-rating="5.0" data-max-rating="5" > <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIOzNgEGRY6aXcHHrIA9PpeZdrN_LRJUfl4G33CrRWxe0qhGw=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIOzNgEGRY6aXcHHrIA9PpeZdrN_LRJUfl4G33CrRWxe0qhGw=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Simone R.N Higgins profile picture"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Simone R.N Higgins </div> <div class="ti-date">February 18, 2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform ti-color-blue"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->It was my 3rd time taking the exam.  I am not a great test taker. But I believe the PBR strategies worked for me. If you follow the plan, I believe you will succeed. Give it a try.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more" ></span> </div> </div> <div class="ti-review-item source-Google ti-image-layout-thumbnail" data-platform-page-url="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Google&amp;query_place_id=ChIJ9SSiyxCrx4kRyvzolqTb8Lc" data-time="1739395948" data-id="121256459a627bc81c5542567cbad659" data-language="en" data-rating="5.0" data-max-rating="5" > <div class="ti-inner"> <div class="ti-review-header"> <div class="ti-platform-icon ti-with-tooltip"> <span class="ti-tooltip">Posted on Google</span> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/icon.svg" alt="Google" width="20" height="20"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-img"> <img decoding="async" class="skip-lazy" src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLfkeBziGld8iFY92kjKsAAiwvQgNSYPH_IEHrheavHOHz3fQ=w40-h40-c-rp-mo-br100" srcset="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLfkeBziGld8iFY92kjKsAAiwvQgNSYPH_IEHrheavHOHz3fQ=w80-h80-c-rp-mo-br100 2x" alt="Cari Rayborn profile picture"  title="Home"> </div> <div class="ti-profile-details"> <div class="ti-name"> Cari Rayborn </div> <div class="ti-date">February 12, 2025</div> </div> </div> <span class="ti-stars"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 1" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 2" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 3" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 4" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><img decoding="async" class="ti-star f skip-lazy" src="https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/platform/Google/star/f.svg" alt="Google star 5" width="17" height="17"  title="Home"><span class="ti-verified-review ti-verified-platform ti-color-blue"><span class="ti-verified-tooltip">Trustindex verifies that the original source of the review is Google.</span></span></span> <div class="ti-review-text-container ti-review-content"><!-- R-CONTENT -->5 stars aren&#039;t enough! PBR is THE key to passing boards. Many companies advertise products to help with initial Peds certification, but the content is often too dense. As someone who likes things to the point, the PBR system was concise enough to give me just what I needed without wasting time or energy. The test taking strategies course is also a game changer. If you struggle with board exams or just want the blueprint, look no further. First time board pass.<!-- R-CONTENT --></div> <span class="ti-read-more" data-container=".ti-review-content" data-collapse-text="Hide" data-open-text="Read more" ></span> </div> </div> </div> <div class="ti-controls-line"> <div class="dot"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </pre><style class="scss-content">.ti-amp-iframe-body{background:#fafafa}.ti-widget[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-widget-container .ti-date{color:#767676}.ti-widget[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-reviews-container-wrapper{padding-top:12px !important;padding-bottom:12px !important}.ti-widget[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-review-item>.ti-inner{border-color:#000000 !important;background-color:#ffffff;background-image:url(https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/img/widget-pattern-dottie.svg);background-position:calc(100% + 70px) -70px;background-size:270px;background-repeat:no-repeat}.ti-widget[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-ai-summary-item .ti-profile-img img:not(.ti-ai-profile-img){border:2px solid #ffffff;border-color:#ffffff}.ti-widget[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-ai-summary-item>.ti-inner{background-color:#ffffff !important;background-image:url(https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/img/widget-pattern-dottie.svg);background-position:calc(100% + 70px) -70px;background-size:270px;background-repeat:no-repeat}.ti-widget[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-review-item>.ti-inner,.ti-widget[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-load-more-reviews-container .ti-load-more-reviews-button{box-shadow:1px 4px 10px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16), 0px 0px 2px 0px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);border-top-width:1px !important;border-bottom-width:1px !important;border-left-width:1px !important;border-right-width:1px !important;background-color:white !important}.ti-widget[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-widget-header{margin-bottom:4px !important;background-color:#fafafa;border-color:#ffffff}.ti-widget-lightbox[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-ai-summary-item .ti-profile-img img:not(.ti-ai-profile-img){border:2px solid #ffffff;border-color:#ffffff}.ti-widget-lightbox[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-ai-summary-item>.ti-inner{background-color:#ffffff !important;background-image:url(https://cdn.trustindex.io/assets/img/widget-pattern-dottie.svg);background-position:calc(100% + 70px) -70px;background-size:270px;background-repeat:no-repeat}.ti-widget[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-widget-header .ti-platform-tabs .ti-tab-item:not(.ti-tab-active):hover{background:#e1e1e1}.ti-widget[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-widget-header .ti-platform-tabs .ti-platform-tab-nav .ti-arrow-next{background:linear-gradient(-90deg, #fafafa 67%, rgba(250, 250, 250, 0) 85%)}.ti-widget[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-widget-header .ti-platform-tabs .ti-platform-tab-nav .ti-arrow-prev{background:linear-gradient(90deg, #fafafa 67%, rgba(250, 250, 250, 0) 85%)}}.ti-widget[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-controls{margin-top:-15px}.ti-widget[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-controls .ti-next:before,.ti-widget[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-controls .ti-prev:before{border-color:#000000}.ti-widget[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-controls-line{background:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35)}.ti-widget[data-layout-id='108'][data-set-id='light-background'][data-pid='5f2523c609e5812a9c76a09e04a'] .ti-controls-line .dot{background:#000000}</style><script>
