<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column44282_2d4201-cd kvs-sm-false"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<figure class="wp-block-kadence-image kb-image44282_7c8dc4-92 size-full"><img width="855" height="1024" decoding="async" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20855%201024'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Pediatrics Board Review founder Dr. Ashish Goyal, a trusted coach for thousands of physicians preparing for board exams." class="kb-img wp-image-50395" title="Home" data-lazy-src="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/ashish-goyal-pbr-founder.webp"><noscript><img width="855" height="1024" decoding="async" src="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/ashish-goyal-pbr-founder.webp" alt="Pediatrics Board Review founder Dr. Ashish Goyal, a trusted coach for thousands of physicians preparing for board exams." class="kb-img wp-image-50395" title="Home"></noscript></figure>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column44282_eb9215-2c"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph" style="font-size:21px;font-style:normal;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5">We help pediatricians pass the boards, even if they’ve been struggling for years.</p>



<h2 class="kt-adv-heading44282_469247-8b fw-5 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading44282_469247-8b">Meet our founder,<br><strong><mark style="background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);color:#008195" class="has-inline-color">ASHISH GOYAL</mark></strong></h2>



<figure class="wp-block-kadence-image kb-image44282_a8b159-63 size-full mobile-imgg"><img width="855" height="1024" decoding="async" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20855%201024'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Dr. Ashish Goyal, creator of the PBR system, smiling confidently as your guide to passing the pediatric boards." class="kb-img wp-image-50395" title="Home" data-lazy-src="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/ashish-goyal-pbr-founder.webp"><noscript><img width="855" height="1024" decoding="async" src="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/ashish-goyal-pbr-founder.webp" alt="Dr. Ashish Goyal, creator of the PBR system, smiling confidently as your guide to passing the pediatric boards." class="kb-img wp-image-50395" title="Home"></noscript></figure>



<p class="has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9 wp-block-paragraph" style="color:#000000;font-size:17px">After failing his pediatric boards, Dr. Ashish Goyal completely restructured his studying technique to embrace a new style of learning that was focused on efficiency and repetition.&nbsp;As a result,&nbsp;he increased his score by 40%, and was invited by the ABP to write board questions for them.&nbsp;That led Ashish to begin a journey that has helped thousands of pediatricians pass their board exams through Pediatrics Board Review®.</p>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-advancedbtn kb-buttons-wrap kb-btns44282_b82a51-1f"><a class="kb-button kt-button button kb-btn44282_b48f3e-14 kt-btn-size-small kt-btn-width-type-auto kb-btn-global-fill kt-btn-has-text-true kt-btn-has-svg-true wp-block-kadence-singlebtn" href="/#who-do-we-help"><span class="kt-btn-inner-text">Get Started</span><span class="kb-svg-icon-wrap kb-svg-icon-fas_angle-right kt-btn-icon-side-right"><svg viewBox="0 0 256 512"  fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"  aria-hidden="true"><path d="M224.3 273l-136 136c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0l-22.6-22.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l96.4-96.4-96.4-96.4c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9L54.3 103c9.4-9.4 24.6-9.4 33.9 0l136 136c9.5 9.4 9.5 24.6.1 34z"/></svg></span></a></div>
</div></div>

