<div class="wp-block-group"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<!--
YOUTUBE CLICK TO PLAY

1. Replace XXX with the YouTube video ID.
   Example: https://youtube.com/watch?v=3FXWNV98rzc  ->  XXX is 3FXWNV98rzc

2. Replace YYY with the thumbnail image URL.
-->

<style></style>



<div
  class="click-video"
  data-embed="https://www.youtube.com/embed/xXJjQodcM9c?autoplay=1&#038;rel=0&#038;modestbranding=1"
>
  <div class="click-video__layer click-video__layer--thumb">
    <img width="640" height="352" decoding="async"
      src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20640%20352'%3E%3C/svg%3E"
      alt="Video thumbnail"
      class="click-video__thumb-img"
     
    data-lazy-src="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/Pediatric-Board-Exam-Results-for-2024-thumbnail.webp" /><noscript><img width="640" height="352" decoding="async"
      src="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/Pediatric-Board-Exam-Results-for-2024-thumbnail.webp"
      alt="Video thumbnail"
      class="click-video__thumb-img"
      loading="lazy"
    /></noscript>
    <button class="click-video__play" type="button" aria-label="Play video"></button>
  </div>
</div>



<script type="rocketlazyloadscript">
(function () {
  // Prevent double initialization if block is duplicated
  if (window.pbrClickVideoInit) return;
  window.pbrClickVideoInit = true;

  document.addEventListener('click', function (event) {
    var wrapper = event.target.closest('.click-video');
    if (!wrapper) return;

    if (wrapper.dataset.played === '1') return;

    var embedUrl = wrapper.getAttribute('data-embed');
    if (!embedUrl) return;

    var iframe = document.createElement('iframe');
    iframe.className = 'click-video__layer click-video__iframe';
    iframe.src = embedUrl;
    iframe.setAttribute(
      'allow',
      'accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share'
    );
    iframe.setAttribute('allowfullscreen', 'true');
    iframe.setAttribute('loading', 'lazy');
    iframe.title = 'Embedded video';

    wrapper.innerHTML = '';
    wrapper.appendChild(iframe);
    wrapper.dataset.played = '1';
  });
})();
</script>
</div></div>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column44282_d17e67-ca"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<p class="kt-adv-heading44282_db25f2-6b wp-block-kadence-advancedheading hls-none" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading44282_db25f2-6b"><a href="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/pediatric-board-exam-results-2024">PEDIATRIC BOARD EXAM RESULTS FOR 2025 AND INSIGHTS FOR 2026</a></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Well, friends, the American Board of Pediatrics exam results for 2025 have been announced! It&#8217;s always an emotional time for us here at PBR HQ. It&#8217;s also overwhelming because we get flooded with emails from the members who have worked so hard over the past year, and have now FINALLY passed the boards! The stories from our 2025 members have been wonderful. To have members say that we have changed their lives has been nothing less than humbling.</p>



