<figure class="wp-block-kadence-image kb-image44282_b1aacf-5e kb-image-is-ratio-size img-blog-card-home"><a href="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/failed-pediatric-boards" class="kb-advanced-image-link"><div class="kb-is-ratio-image kb-image-ratio-land32"><img decoding="async" width="358" height="253" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20358%20253'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="pediatrics board review failed" class="kb-img wp-image-48628" title="Home" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/pediatrics-board-review-failed.webp 358w, https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/pediatrics-board-review-failed-300x212.webp 300w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 358px) 100vw, 358px" data-lazy-src="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/pediatrics-board-review-failed.webp" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="358" height="253" src="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/pediatrics-board-review-failed.webp" alt="pediatrics board review failed" class="kb-img wp-image-48628" title="Home" srcset="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/pediatrics-board-review-failed.webp 358w, https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/pediatrics-board-review-failed-300x212.webp 300w" sizes="(max-width: 358px) 100vw, 358px" /></noscript></div></a></figure>



<p class="kt-adv-heading44282_78ef08-2a wp-block-kadence-advancedheading hls-none" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading44282_78ef08-2a"><a href="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/failed-pediatric-boards">So You Failed The Pediatric Boards? Use A Recovery Plan That Works!</a></p>



<p class="kt-adv-heading44282_999412-73 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading44282_999412-73">Since I failed the first time too, and then I increased my score by 40%, I know how to help you pass. Follow this step-by-step guide with an easy-to-follow structure, study schedule, and recommendations on test-taking strategy to pass.</p>
