<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column44282_abdbc6-01 before-line-post"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id44282_622857-25 alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column44282_393669-7f"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<figure class="wp-block-kadence-image kb-image44282_30360a-90 kb-image-is-ratio-size"><a href="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/why-prep-questions-are-not-the-best-study-questions" class="kb-advanced-image-link"><div class="kb-is-ratio-image kb-image-ratio-land32"><img decoding="async" width="358" height="238" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20358%20238'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Are AAP Prep Questions Good to Study" class="kb-img wp-image-48633" title="Home" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/Are-AAP-Prep-Questions-Good-to-Study.webp 358w, https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/Are-AAP-Prep-Questions-Good-to-Study-300x199.webp 300w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 358px) 100vw, 358px" data-lazy-src="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/Are-AAP-Prep-Questions-Good-to-Study.webp" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="358" height="238" src="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/Are-AAP-Prep-Questions-Good-to-Study.webp" alt="Are AAP Prep Questions Good to Study" class="kb-img wp-image-48633" title="Home" srcset="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/Are-AAP-Prep-Questions-Good-to-Study.webp 358w, https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/Are-AAP-Prep-Questions-Good-to-Study-300x199.webp 300w" sizes="(max-width: 358px) 100vw, 358px" /></noscript></div></a></figure>



<p class="kt-adv-heading44282_ebd31c-85 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading hls-none" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading44282_ebd31c-85"><a href="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/why-prep-questions-are-not-the-best-study-questions">Why AAP PREP Questions Are NOT The Best Study Questions For the Pediatric Board Exam</a></p>



<p class="kt-adv-heading44282_68bcc5-76 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading44282_68bcc5-76">Pediatricians often treat AAP prep questions as a study resource. This is a very common mistake. Read this article to understand the difference between how you should, and how you should not, use the AAP&#8217;s prep questions to help you pass the pediatric boards!</p>
</div></div>

</div></div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column44282_b77c7c-b1 before-line-post"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id44282_16cc64-2a alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column44282_ac9446-1e"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<figure class="wp-block-kadence-image kb-image44282_d22be3-23 kb-image-is-ratio-size"><a href="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/how-many-aap-prep-questions-should-i-do" class="kb-advanced-image-link"><div class="kb-is-ratio-image kb-image-ratio-land32"><img decoding="async" width="346" height="243" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20346%20243'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="How Many AAP Prep Questions for Board Review 1" class="kb-img wp-image-48632" title="Home" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/How-Many-AAP-Prep-Questions-for-Board-Review-1.webp 346w, https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/How-Many-AAP-Prep-Questions-for-Board-Review-1-300x211.webp 300w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 346px) 100vw, 346px" data-lazy-src="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/How-Many-AAP-Prep-Questions-for-Board-Review-1.webp" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="346" height="243" src="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/How-Many-AAP-Prep-Questions-for-Board-Review-1.webp" alt="How Many AAP Prep Questions for Board Review 1" class="kb-img wp-image-48632" title="Home" srcset="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/How-Many-AAP-Prep-Questions-for-Board-Review-1.webp 346w, https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/How-Many-AAP-Prep-Questions-for-Board-Review-1-300x211.webp 300w" sizes="(max-width: 346px) 100vw, 346px" /></noscript></div></a></figure>



<p class="kt-adv-heading44282_38ea2f-99 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading hls-none" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading44282_38ea2f-99"><a href="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/how-many-aap-prep-questions-should-i-do">How Many AAP Prep Questions Should I Do to Pass the Pediatric Boards?</a></p>



<p class="kt-adv-heading44282_fd370a-a4 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading44282_fd370a-a4">When using the AAP PREP questions for PRACTICING board-style questions, is there a minimum number of questions I should do? Is there a better way to use PREP questions to prepare? Should I use them to study? Get all your questions answered in this article!</p>
</div></div>

</div></div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column44282_92bbff-4d"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col"><div class="kb-row-layout-wrap kb-row-layout-id44282_2785e3-5e alignnone wp-block-kadence-rowlayout"><div class="kt-row-column-wrap kt-has-1-columns kt-row-layout-equal kt-tab-layout-inherit kt-mobile-layout-row kt-row-valign-top">

<div class="wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column44282_39736a-ab"><div class="kt-inside-inner-col">
<figure class="wp-block-kadence-image kb-image44282_bf83a1-ad kb-image-is-ratio-size img-blog-card-home"><a href="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/test-taking-strategies-medical-board-exams" class="kb-advanced-image-link"><div class="kb-is-ratio-image kb-image-ratio-land32"><img decoding="async" width="327" height="239" src="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20327%20239'%3E%3C/svg%3E" alt="Puzzle pieces with the word strategy centered in blue highlighting planning teamwork and success Keywords like brand optimize and vision surround the central concept" class="kb-img wp-image-48271" title="Home" data-lazy-srcset="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/Use-Test-Taking-Strategy-to-Help-You-Pass.webp 327w, https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/Use-Test-Taking-Strategy-to-Help-You-Pass-300x219.webp 300w" data-lazy-sizes="(max-width: 327px) 100vw, 327px" data-lazy-src="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/Use-Test-Taking-Strategy-to-Help-You-Pass.webp" /><noscript><img decoding="async" width="327" height="239" src="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/Use-Test-Taking-Strategy-to-Help-You-Pass.webp" alt="Puzzle pieces with the word strategy centered in blue highlighting planning teamwork and success Keywords like brand optimize and vision surround the central concept" class="kb-img wp-image-48271" title="Home" srcset="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/Use-Test-Taking-Strategy-to-Help-You-Pass.webp 327w, https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/wp-content/uploads/Use-Test-Taking-Strategy-to-Help-You-Pass-300x219.webp 300w" sizes="(max-width: 327px) 100vw, 327px" /></noscript></div></a></figure>



<p class="kt-adv-heading44282_8ae543-fc wp-block-kadence-advancedheading hls-none" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading44282_8ae543-fc"><a href="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/test-taking-strategies-medical-board-exams">Test-Taking Strategies for Medical Board Exams</a></p>



<p class="kt-adv-heading44282_40db3d-16 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading44282_40db3d-16">It&#8217;s possible that you are not a great test-taker. Focusing only on the topics is not enough. You need to develop strong test-taking strategies to help you break-down, process, and answer questions quickly! Learn 3 strategies that you can incorporate instantly to help you pass any medical board exam.</p>
</div></div>

</div></div></div></div>



