<p class="kt-adv-heading44282_0dc280-89 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading hls-none" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading44282_0dc280-89"><a href="https://www.pediatricsboardreview.com/pediatric-mnemonics">Creating Memorable Pediatric Mnemonics</a></p>



<p class="kt-adv-heading44282_9dafb6-bc wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading44282_9dafb6-bc">It&#8217;s impossible to remember 2500 pediatric topics through rote memorization. Learning how to create simple (but effective) mnemonics can make or break your score on the pediatric boards. Read this article on creating high quality mnemonics and get access to FREE mnemonics from the PBR Core Study Guide.</p>
